msgid "There is a Mihomo widget for the panel."
msgstr "面板上有一個 Mihomo 小工具。"

msgid "Other programs can use this address as it is."
msgstr "其他程式可以直接用這個位址。"

msgid "This switch only starts the local proxy."
msgstr "這個開關只負責打開本機代理。"

msgid "This takes effect only while the core is running and TUN is off."
msgstr "只有內核開著、而且 TUN 關著的時候，這個才會生效。"

msgid "Restart the core with the configuration it already has."
msgstr "用現在這份設定重新啟動核心。"

msgid "See which region the traffic is leaving from."
msgstr "看看流量現在是從哪個地區出去的。"

msgid "HTTP and SOCKS share this port, and saving restarts a running core."
msgstr "HTTP 和 SOCKS 共用這個連接埠，儲存後正在跑的核心會重新啟動。"

msgid "This page talks to the controller, which listens only on this computer."
msgstr "這個頁面透過控制器通訊，控制器只在這台電腦上監聽。"

msgid "This is the mihomo program already installed on the system."
msgstr "這是系統裡已經裝好的那個 mihomo。"

msgid "This file is placed over the subscription, while the listen address stays set here."
msgstr "這個檔案蓋在訂閱上面，監聽位址仍然在這裡決定。"

msgid "A subscription update replaces the text written here."
msgstr "從訂閱更新的話，這裡寫的內容會被換掉。"

msgid "TUN"
msgstr "TUN"

msgid "This captures only this account's traffic, and the system proxy steps aside while it is on."
msgstr "這只截取這個帳戶的流量，打開時系統代理會先讓開。"

msgid "Users"
msgstr "使用者"

msgid "This page starts and stops Mihomo for accounts that are signed in."
msgstr "這一頁用來開關已登入帳戶自己的 Mihomo。"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "帳戶"

msgid "On"
msgstr "開"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "關"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "啟動"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Check"
msgstr "檢查"

msgid "Open in editor"
msgstr "用編輯器開啟"

msgid "This configuration can be read."
msgstr "這份設定可以讀。"

msgid "No text editor was found."
msgstr "找不到文字編輯器。"

msgid "View log"
msgstr "查看日誌"

msgid "Core log"
msgstr "內核日誌"

msgid "There is no log yet."
msgstr "還沒有日誌。"

msgid "Start this account's core"
msgstr "啟動這個帳戶的內核"

msgid "Stop this account's core"
msgstr "停止這個帳戶的內核"

msgid "The core is running."
msgstr "內核正在執行。"

msgid "The core is stopped."
msgstr "內核已停止。"

msgid "Traffic capture"
msgstr "流量截取"

msgid "This account"
msgstr "目前帳戶"

msgid "No signed-in accounts."
msgstr "沒有已登入的帳戶。"

msgid "This page starts or stops the core of a signed-in account."
msgstr "這一頁用來啟動或停止已登入帳戶的內核。"

msgid "The firewall is on, and it can drop TUN traffic."
msgstr "防火牆開著，它可能會丟掉 TUN 的流量。"

msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "設定檔"

msgid "No profiles yet"
msgstr "還沒有設定檔"

msgid "Remove this profile?"
msgstr "移除這個設定檔？"

msgid "Test delay automatically"
msgstr "自動測試延遲"

msgid "Use the same sort for every group"
msgstr "所有策略組使用同一種排序"

msgid "Tests the delay of the group you are looking at."
msgstr "打開策略組時自動測試它的延遲。"

msgid "Blur the IP"
msgstr "模糊 IP"

msgid "Hides the latter half of the exit address; right-click copies the full address, and three quick clicks show it."
msgstr "隱藏出口位址的後半段；右鍵複製完整位址，連點三次則顯示出來。"

msgid "TUN device"
msgstr "虛擬網卡"

msgid "Leave this empty to let the kernel choose the name, and applying a new name asks you to confirm."
msgstr "留空則由核心自己命名，套用新名稱時需要驗證身分。"

msgid "Open file"
msgstr "打開檔案"

msgid "Opens the override file, creating it from the template when it is missing."
msgstr "打開覆蓋檔案，不存在時按範本建立。"

msgid "Open folder"
msgstr "打開資料夾"

msgid "Opens the folder that contains the override file."
msgstr "打開覆蓋檔案所在的資料夾。"

msgid "Keeps one sort and filter for every group and profile."
msgstr "記住一套排序和篩選，用在每個策略組和每個設定檔上。"

