msgstr "授權條款"

msgid "Website"
msgstr "網站"

msgid "Mihomo"
msgstr "Mihomo"

msgid "Pointing at this core."
msgstr "正指向這個核心。"

msgid "Pointing somewhere else."
msgstr "指向了別處。"

msgid "Not set."
msgstr "沒有設定。"

msgid "KDE proxy"
msgstr "KDE 代理"

msgid "GNOME proxy"
msgstr "GNOME 代理"

msgid "Shows whether KDE is telling programs to use a proxy."
msgstr "顯示 KDE 是否在告訴程式走代理。"

msgid "Shows whether GNOME is telling programs to use a proxy."
msgstr "顯示 GNOME 是否在告訴程式走代理。"

msgid "This computer"
msgstr "這台電腦"

msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "帳戶"

msgid "Manage signed-in accounts"
msgstr "管理已登入的帳戶"

msgid "Asks for the administrator password, then lists the other signed-in accounts."
msgstr "先問管理員密碼，然後列出其他已登入的帳戶。"

msgid "Lock"
msgstr "鎖定"

msgid "Capture the whole computer"
msgstr "擷取整台電腦"

msgid "Sends every account and root through this account's configuration."
msgstr "讓所有帳戶和 root 走這個帳戶的設定。"

msgid "Signed-in accounts"
msgstr "已登入的帳戶"

msgid "No other signed-in accounts."
msgstr "沒有其他已登入的帳戶。"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "返回"

msgid "Exit"
msgstr "出口"

msgid "Other"
msgstr "其他"

msgid "No matches"
msgstr "沒有相符項目"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "複製"

msgid "Copied the address."
msgstr "已複製位址。"

msgid "Allow LAN"
msgstr "允許區域網路"

msgid "The administrator turned this off."
msgstr "管理員關閉了這項。"

msgid "Lets other computers on the local network use the mixed port. The controller stays on this computer."
msgstr "區域網路裡的其他電腦可以使用混合連接埠。控制器仍然只在這台電腦上。"

msgid "Username"
msgstr "使用者名稱"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "密碼"

msgid "Lets every account open its mixed port to the local network."
msgstr "每個帳戶都可以把混合連接埠對區域網路開放。"

msgid "Allow LAN for this account"
msgstr "允許這個帳戶使用區域網路"

msgid "When this is off, this account's mixed port stays on this computer."
msgstr "關閉後，這個帳戶的混合連接埠只留在這台電腦上。"

msgid "When this is off, that account's mixed port stays on this computer."
msgstr "關閉後，那個帳戶的混合連接埠只留在這台電腦上。"

msgid "Adds a route to the current profile, which a subscription update replaces."
msgstr "往目前設定檔加入一條路線。更新訂閱會整份替換這個檔案。"

msgid "Removes the selected route from the current profile, which a subscription update replaces."
msgstr "從目前設定檔移除選取的路線。更新訂閱會整份替換這個檔案。"

msgid "Remove this route?"
msgstr "要移除這條路線嗎？"

msgid "Add a route"
msgstr "加入路線"

msgid "Show details"
msgstr "顯示詳細資料"

msgid "Hide details"
msgstr "隱藏詳細資料"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "儲存"

msgid "Server"
msgstr "伺服器"

msgid "Route"
msgstr "路線"
